Subject: Upcoming Bioconductor 3.7 release, developed for R 3.5.0
Message-ID: <20180418014609.zywykatoutocp46u@kumo.plessy.net>

Hi all,

The 3.7 release of Bioconductor is planned for May 1st.

On that day, the packages that are currently in the "devel" branch will
go in the "current" branch, which our watch files are tracking.

Bioconductor 3.6 is developed and tested on R 3.4, and Bioconductor 3.7
is developed and tested on R 3.5, for which the transition will soon
start Debian.

